# 状态管理规范（Zustand）

## 1. 何时用 Zustand Store

- ✅ 跨页/跨组件共享数据（学员列表、教师列表、当前校区、当前身份）
- ✅ 需要持久化到 Taro Storage 的会话数据（`AuthProvider` 已封装）
- ✅ 复杂派生计算（教师薪资计算 `calcTotal`、筛选过滤 `getFilteredTeachers`）
- ❌ 仅组件内部用的 UI 状态（弹窗显隐、表单输入）— 用 `useState`
- ❌ 一次性网络请求结果，渲染即用 — 直接用 `useState` + `useEffect` 即可

## 2. 文件结构

```
src/stores/
├── index.ts          # 统一导出（页面只从这导入）
├── teacher.ts        # 教师 Store
├── student.ts        # 学员 Store
├── class.ts          # 班级 Store
├── campus.ts         # 校区 Store
├── lead.ts           # 线索 Store
├── agreement.ts      # 协议 Store
├── package-template.ts # 套餐模板 Store
└── theme.ts          # 主题 Store
```

## 3. 标准模板

```ts
// src/stores/teacher.ts
import { create } from 'zustand';
import { teacherService } from '@/services';
import type { TeacherUIModel, SalaryModel, TeacherFilter } from '@/types/teacher';

export interface TeacherStoreState {
  // ===== 数据 =====
  teachers: TeacherUIModel[];
  salaryModels: SalaryModel[];
  filter: TeacherFilter;
  selectedIds: string[];
  settings: TeacherSettings;
  loading: boolean;
  error: string | null;

  // ===== Actions =====
  fetchTeachers: () => Promise<void>;
  fetchAll: () => Promise<void>;
  setFilter: (filter: Partial<TeacherFilter>) => void;
  getFilteredTeachers: () => TeacherUIModel[];

  confirmSalary: (id: string) => Promise<void>;
  batchConfirm: (ids: string[]) => Promise<void>;
  executePay: (ids: string[], remark?: string) => Promise<void>;

  addTeacher: (t: TeacherUIModel) => Promise<void>;
  updateTeacher: (id: string, updates: Partial<TeacherUIModel>) => Promise<void>;
  resignTeacher: (id: string, reason: string) => Promise<void>;

  addDeduction: (teacherId: string, deduction: Deduction) => Promise<void>;
  createSalaryModel: (model: SalaryModel) => Promise<void>;

  // ===== 派生选择器 =====
  getActiveCount: () => number;
  getPendingCount: () => number;
  getTotalHours: () => number;
  getTotalSalary: () => number;
}

export const useTeacherStore = create<TeacherStoreState>((set, get) => ({
  // ===== 初始状态 =====
  teachers: [],
  salaryModels: [],
  filter: { campusId: undefined, subject: undefined, status: undefined },
  selectedIds: [],
  settings: {},
  loading: false,
  error: null,

  // ===== Actions =====
  fetchTeachers: async () => {
    set({ loading: true, error: null });
    try {
      const list = await teacherService.getList();
      set({ teachers: list, loading: false });
    } catch (err) {
      set({ error: err instanceof Error ? err.message : '获取失败', loading: false });
    }
  },

  fetchAll: async () => {
    set({ loading: true, error: null });
    try {
      const [teachers, salaryModels] = await Promise.all([
        teacherService.getList(),
        teacherService.getSalaryModels(),
      ]);
      set({ teachers, salaryModels, loading: false });
    } catch (err) {
      set({ error: err instanceof Error ? err.message : '获取失败', loading: false });
    }
  },

  setFilter: (filter) => set((s) => ({ filter: { ...s.filter, ...filter } })),

  getFilteredTeachers: () => {
    const { teachers, filter } = get();
    return teachers.filter((t) => {
      if (filter.campusId && t.campusId !== filter.campusId) return false;
      if (filter.subject && t.subject !== filter.subject) return false;
      if (filter.status && t.status !== filter.status) return false;
      return true;
    });
  },

  confirmSalary: async (id) => {
    await teacherService.confirmSalary(id);
    set((s) => ({
      teachers: s.teachers.map((t) =>
        t.id === id ? { ...t, salaryStatus: 'confirmed' } : t,
      ),
    }));
  },

  batchConfirm: async (ids) => {
    await teacherService.batchConfirm(ids);
    set((s) => ({
      teachers: s.teachers.map((t) =>
        ids.includes(t.id) ? { ...t, salaryStatus: 'confirmed' } : t,
      ),
    }));
  },

  executePay: async (ids, remark) => {
    await teacherService.executePay(ids, remark);
    set((s) => ({
      teachers: s.teachers.map((t) =>
        ids.includes(t.id) ? { ...t, salaryStatus: 'paid' } : t,
      ),
    }));
  },

  addTeacher: async (t) => {
    const created = await teacherService.add(t);
    set((s) => ({ teachers: [...s.teachers, created] }));
  },

  updateTeacher: async (id, updates) => {
    await teacherService.update(id, updates);
    set((s) => ({
      teachers: s.teachers.map((t) => (t.id === id ? { ...t, ...updates } : t)),
    }));
  },

  resignTeacher: async (id, reason) => {
    await teacherService.resign(id, 'resign', reason);
    set((s) => ({
      teachers: s.teachers.map((t) => (t.id === id ? { ...t, status: 'resigned' } : t)),
    }));
  },

  addDeduction: async (teacherId, deduction) => {
    const created = await teacherService.addDeduction(teacherId, deduction);
    set((s) => ({
      teachers: s.teachers.map((t) =>
        t.id === teacherId ? { ...t, deductions: [...t.deductions, created] } : t,
      ),
    }));
  },

  createSalaryModel: async (model) => {
    const created = await teacherService.createSalaryModel(model);
    set((s) => ({ salaryModels: [...s.salaryModels, created] }));
  },

  // ===== 派生计算 =====
  getActiveCount: () => get().teachers.filter((t) => t.status === 'active').length,
  getPendingCount: () => get().teachers.filter((t) => t.salaryStatus === 'pending').length,
  getTotalHours: () => get().teachers.reduce((sum, t) => sum + t.hours, 0),
  getTotalSalary: () => get().teachers.reduce((sum, t) => sum + calcTotal(t), 0),
}));

// ===== 工具函数（可独立导出，便于测试）=====
export function calcTotal(t: TeacherUIModel): number {
  const lessonFee = t.hours * t.rate;
  let total = t.base + lessonFee + t.attend + t.perf;
  t.deductions.forEach((d) => {
    total += d.type === 'bonus' ? d.amount : -d.amount;
  });
  return Math.max(0, total);
}
```

## 4. 状态机严格单向（铁律）

### 薪资状态：`pending → confirmed → paid`

```ts
// ✅ 正向更新
teacher.status: 'pending' → 'confirmed' → 'paid'

// ❌ 禁止反向跳转
teacher.status: 'paid' → 'pending'   // 禁止
teacher.status: 'confirmed' → 'pending'  // 禁止
```

### 线索状态：`new → pending → booked → arrived/not_arrived → following → converted/closed`

- 必须按状态机路径流转，跨级跳转需经业务确认（不允许跳过中间状态）。

## 5. 使用规范

### 5.1 组件内订阅

```tsx
// ✅ 选择性订阅（推荐，避免不必要 re-render）
const teachers = useTeacherStore((s) => s.teachers);
const loading = useTeacherStore((s) => s.loading);

// ✅ 一次性调用 action
const fetchTeachers = useTeacherStore((s) => s.fetchTeachers);
useEffect(() => { fetchTeachers(); }, [fetchTeachers]);

// ❌ 错误：订阅整个 store（每次任何字段变化都触发 re-render）
const store = useTeacherStore();
```

### 5.2 派生数据

```tsx
// ✅ 简单派生：用 selector
const activeCount = useTeacherStore((s) =>
  s.teachers.filter((t) => t.status === 'active').length,
);

// ✅ 复杂派生：用 useMemo
const stats = useMemo(
  () => ({
    total: teachers.length,
    active: teachers.filter((t) => t.status === 'active').length,
    pending: teachers.filter((t) => t.salaryStatus === 'pending').length,
  }),
  [teachers],
);
```

### 5.3 不要在 Store 中持有 UI 状态

```ts
// ❌ 错误：把弹窗显隐放 Store
const useUiStore = create((set) => ({
  showAddTeacherSheet: false,
  setShowAddTeacherSheet: (v) => set({ showAddTeacherSheet: v }),
}));

// ✅ 正确：弹窗状态是页面局部 UI
const [showSheet, setShowSheet] = useState(false);
```

## 6. 持久化

### 6.1 简单场景：`zustand/middleware` 的 `persist`

```ts
import { persist, createJSONStorage } from 'zustand/middleware';
import Taro from '@tarojs/taro';

const useThemeStore = create(
  persist(
    (set) => ({ activeTheme: 'blue', setActiveTheme: (t) => set({ activeTheme: t }) }),
    {
      name: 'yunce-edu-theme',
      storage: createJSONStorage(() => ({
        getItem: (key) => Taro.getStorageSync(key),
        setItem: (key, value) => Taro.setStorageSync(key, value),
        removeItem: (key) => Taro.removeStorageSync(key),
      })),
    },
  ),
);
```

### 6.2 复杂场景：会话状态用 `AuthProvider`（Context）

- 登录会话、身份切换等走 `src/utils/auth.tsx` 的 `AuthProvider`，**不要**自己再开一个 Store。
- 持久化已经在 `AuthProvider` 内部封装。

## 7. 服务层调用

- Store **只能**调用 `teacherService.xxx(...)`，**禁止**直接调用 `@/data/xxx`。
- 真实 API 与 DTO 适配由 Service 层封装，Store 维护状态与缓存失效。

## 8. 自检

- [ ] 文件 `src/stores/{module}.ts` + `export const useXxxStore`
- [ ] `src/stores/index.ts` 统一导出
- [ ] 页面从 `@/stores` 导入，不直接引用内部文件
- [ ] Store 只调 `@/services`，不直接调 `@/data`
- [ ] 组件用 selector 订阅，不订阅整个 store
- [ ] UI 状态（弹窗、表单输入）走 `useState`
- [ ] 状态机严格单向（薪资 `pending → confirmed → paid`）
- [ ] 错误处理走 try/catch，更新 `error` 字段
- [ ] Loading 状态用 `loading` 字段，避免 race condition
- [ ] 派生计算要么用 selector，要么独立导出工具函数
